Fixed in SVN. Thanks for the bug! If you do not use svn trunk, as a
trivial workaround, run the following whenever you start rkward:

setwd <- function (x) {
	owd <- getwd ()
	rkward::setwd (x)
	invisible (owd)
}

Thomas: I hope there are there are no side affects!

-- 
Prasenjit



